#: data/json/construction/construct.json
#: data/json/construction/construct_deco.json
#: data/json/construction/construct_furn.json
#: data/mods/pride_flags/construction.json
msgid "Can be deconstructed without tools."
msgstr "Pode ser desconstruído sem ferramentas."

#: data/json/construction/construct.json
msgid "Needs to be supported on both sides by fencing, walls, etc."
msgstr "Precisa ser apoiado em ambos os lados por cercas, paredes, etc."

#: data/json/construction/construct.json
msgid "Must be supported on at least two sides."
msgstr "Deve ser suportado em pelo menos dois lados."

#: data/json/construction/construct.json
msgid ""
"Can be deconstructed without tools.  Must be adjacent to a palisade wall "
"that is itself adjacent to a palisade gate in order to open said gate."
msgstr ""
" Pode ser desconstruído sem ferramentas. Deve ser adjacente a uma parede "
"depaliçada que seja adjacente a um portão de paliçada para abrir o "
"ditoportão."

#: data/json/construction/construct.json
msgid ""
"Must be between palisade walls to function, and at least one wall must have "
"an adjacent rope & pulley system."
msgstr ""
" Deve estar entre paredes de paliçada para funcionar e pelo menos uma "
"parededeve ter um sistema de corda e polia adjacente."

#: data/json/construction/construct.json
msgid "You need a deep pit to construct a root cellar."
msgstr "Você precisa de um buraco profundo para construir uma adega."

#: data/json/construction/construct.json
msgid ""
"Must be adjacent to a brick, concrete, stone or plastered wooden wall that "
"is itself adjacent to a garage gate in order to open said gate."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct.json
msgid ""
"Must be between brick or (reinforced)concrete walls to function, and at "
"least one wall must have an adjacent mechanical winch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Build a concrete ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  The "
"high end of a ramp must be built adjacent to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Build a concrete ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  It "
"must be built next to a low end of a ramp to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Build a rammed earth ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  The "
"high end of a ramp must be built adjacent to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Build a rammed earth ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  It "
"must be built next to a low end of a ramp to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Build a wooden ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding"
" ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  The high end of a "
"ramp must be built adjacent to allow moving between z-levels in both "
"directions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Build a wooden ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding"
" ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  It must be built "
"next to a low end of a ramp to allow moving between z-levels in both "
"directions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Digs a simple stone ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  The "
"high end of a ramp must be built adjacent to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Digs a simple stone ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the "
"corresponding ramp down leading from the z-level above to this level.  It "
"must be built next to a low end of a ramp to allow moving between z-levels "
"in both directions."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Removes any remaining material left in the pit, and smooths and reinforces "
"the surrounding ground to not fall in."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid ""
"Mines a hole straight through a rock floor; adding wood to not allow nearby "
"rocks to fill the hole. You see no possible way this could go wrong."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid "Covers any reinforced holes with some 2x4 to make a crude bridge."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_dig.json
msgid "Reinforces a 2x4 plank bridge into a much more sturdy metal version."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_furn.json
msgid ""
"Firing will automatically target the first practice target found in gun "
"range, if no enemies are around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_furn.json
#: data/json/construction/construct_workshop.json
msgid ""
"Will only work if constructed in/on a building that has an electric grid "
"with a mounted battery."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_other.json
msgid "Certain terrain and furniture can be deconstructed without any tools."
msgstr ""
" Determinados terrenos e móveis podem ser desconstruídos sem "
"quaisquerferramentas."

#: data/json/construction/construct_other.json
msgid ""
"Mark a spot for crafting.  Crafting tasks next to this tile will "
"automatically use this location instead of attempting to craft in your "
"hands, with the usual crafting speed penalty for working on the ground.  "
"Does not prevent using a proper workbench, if available.  Deconstruct or "
"smash to remove."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_other.json
msgid "Will be harvestable after one season."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/construction/construct_other.json
msgid ""
"Firewood or other flammable materials on a nearby tile marked in this way "
"may be used to automatically refuel fires.  This will be done to maintain "
"light during long-running tasks that require it such as crafting or reading,"
" but not (for example) if you are simply waiting nearby."
msgstr ""
" A lenha ou outros materiais inflamáveis em uma telha próxima marcada "
"destamaneira podem ser usados para reabastecer automaticamente os incêndios."
" Isso será feito para manter a luz durante tarefas demoradas que o exigem, "
"como a criação ou a leitura, mas não (por exemplo) se você "
"simplesmenteestiver esperando nas proximidades."

#: data/json/construction/construct_other.json
msgid ""
"Mark a spot for target practice.  Firing will automatically target the first"
" practice target location found in gun range, if no enemies are around."
msgstr ""
" Marque um ponto para a prática de tiro ao alvo. O disparo "
"iráautomaticamente atingir o primeiro local de treino encontrado no alcance "
"daarma, se não houver inimigos por perto."

#: data/json/construction/construct_other.json
msgid ""
"Remove a section of roof while carefully reinforcing the area to not "
"collapse."
msgstr ""

