msgid ""
"This is a handmade laser weapon with an equally handmade heat sink, using "
"evaporative cooling to allow for a higher rate of fire.  It's massively "
"heavy, but the lack of recoil means it's still somewhat manageable as a "
"weapon if you can lift it.  It uses UPS power, and you need to fill the "
