#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "pair of scissors"
msgid_plural "pairs of scissors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of scissors', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. scissors'}
#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid ""
"These are a long pair of heavy-duty scissors.  Use scissors to cut items "
"made from cotton (like clothing) into rags."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "paper"
msgid_plural "papers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for paper
#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "A piece of paper.  Can be used for fires."
msgstr "Um pedaço de papel. Pode ser usado para incêndios."

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "bone sewing awl"
msgid_plural "bone sewing awls"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone sewing awl'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a crude sharpened bone awl; those were used for leatherworking "
"before metal was discovered.  It can also serve as an improvised stabbing "
"weapon, but will break quickly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "steel sewing awl"
msgid_plural "steel sewing awls"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'steel sewing awl'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a steel awl with a wooden grip, usually used for leatherworking.  It"
" can also serve as an improvised stabbing weapon, but will break quickly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "knitting needles"
msgid_plural "pairs of knitting needles"
msgstr[0] "par de agulhas de tricô"
msgstr[1] "pares de agulhas de tricô"
msgstr[2] "pares de agulhas de tricô"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'knitting needles', 'str_pl': 'pairs of knitting
#. needles'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stout wooden needles with round ends used to turn thread and yarn "
"into cloth."
msgstr ""
"Um par de agulhas de madeira robustas com extremidades redondas usadas para "
"transformar linha e fio em pano."

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "bone needle"
msgid_plural "bone needles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone needle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is sharp needle made from a bone.  It would be useful for making rough "
"clothing and items.  Its low quality makes it rather unsuitable for anything"
" requiring speed or precision."
msgstr ""
" agulha de ossoEsta é agulha afiada feita de um osso. Seria útil "
"parafazerroupas e itens ásperos. Sua baixa qualidade torna-o "
"bastanteinadequadopara qualquer coisa que exija velocidade ou precisão."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'curved needle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A curved sharp needle made of steel.  Its rounded shape allows it to make "
"stitches that only pierce one side of the material.  While unsuitable for "
"most tailoring projects, it's a necessity for stitching neoprene."
msgstr ""
" agulha curvaA agulha afiada curva de aço. Sua forma arredondadapermitefazer"
" pontos que perfuram apenas um lado do material. Emborasejainadequado para a"
" maioria dos projetos de alfaiataria, é umanecessidadepara costurar "
"neoprene."

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "wooden needle"
msgid_plural "wooden needles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden needle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a wooden needle whittled down to a sharp point.  It has a narrow "
"hole carved into the head for threading.  Its low quality makes it rather "
"unsuitable for anything requiring speed or precision, or involving tougher "
"materials like Kevlar."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/tools.json
msgid "sewing kit"
msgid_plural "sewing kits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sewing kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic kit with a variety of needles, some plastic spools for "
"thread, and a few other useful textile tools.  Use a sewing kit on an "
"article of clothing to attempt to repair or reinforce that clothing.  This "
"uses your tailoring skill, and can also sew pockets or warmer liner into "
"your gear, or resize it for mutant wearers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "tailoring pattern set"
msgid_plural "tailoring pattern sets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tailoring pattern set'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a large set of tailoring patterns made from paper.  They're useful "
"for making any kind of cloth or leather items from scratch, but are "
"necessary for more advanced projects."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/tools.json
msgid "tailor's kit"
msgid_plural "tailor's kits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': "tailor's kit"}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a high quality kit consisting of a variety of needles, some plastic "
"spools for thread, some small scissors, and an awl.  Using your tailoring "
"skill, this kit can customize your clothing and armor, whether up-armoring "
"them or altering some items to fit mutant wearers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
