#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
msgid ""
"A closed cycle, external combustion steam engine.  Burns coal or charcoal "
"from a bunker in the vehicle to produce steam."
msgstr ""
" Um ciclo fechado, motor a vapor de combustão externa. Queima carvão ou "
"carvão de um bunker no veículo para produzir vapor."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
msgid ""
"A closed cycle steam engine powering a hefty turbine.  Burns coal or "
"charcoal from a bunker in the vehicle to produce steam, its power will not "
"diminish even when multiple of them are installed."
msgstr ""

