#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "boom crane"
msgstr "guindaste de lança"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boom crane'}
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A rigid steel boom crane.  If it is in your line of sight and within two "
"tiles of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you jack up the"
" other vehicle to change the its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy "
"component like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must"
" have line of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of"
" it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "internal boom crane"
msgstr "guindaste de lança interna"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "telescopic crane"
msgstr "guindaste telescópico"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'telescopic crane'}
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid ""
"An extendable cantilever crane.  If it is in your line of sight and within "
"two tiles of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you jack up"
" the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy "
"component like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must"
" have line of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of"
" it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet lifter'}
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A small pallet lifter.  If it is in your line of sight and within two tiles "
"of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you jack up the other"
" vehicle to change the its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy component like"
" an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must have line of "
"sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "forklift arm"
msgstr "braço de empilhadeira"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'forklift arm'}
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A pair of forklift arms.  If it is in your line of sight and within two "
"tiles of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you jack up the"
" other vehicle to change the its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy "
"component like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must"
" have line of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of"
" it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "carbon fiber forklift arm"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rockwheel'}
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A large metal disc, powered by the vehicle's engines.  Use the vehicle "
"controls to turn it on or off.  When turned on, it will stop the vehicle "
"unless it has a strong engine.  When turned on, it will dig a shallow pit in"
" dirt.  Mount it on the edge of your vehicle."
msgstr ""
" Um disco de metal grande, alimentado pelos motores do veículo. Use os "
"controles do veículo para ligá-lo ou desligá-lo. Quando ligado, ele irá "
"parar o veículo, a menos que tenha um motor forte. Quando ligado, cavará um "
"buraco raso na terra. Montá-lo na borda do seu veículo."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "air jack system"
msgstr "sistema de tomada de ar"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'air jack system'}
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid ""
"An extendable metal pylon used to replace a portable jack.  If mounted to a "
"vehicle, it could be used to lift it up."
msgstr ""
" airjack Um poste de metal extensível usado para substituir "
"umconectorportátil. Se montado em um veículo, ele poderia ser usado "
"paralevantá-lo."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'motorcycle kickstand'}
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A kickstand to keep the bike from falling over.  You could use this to lean "
"it forward or backward to change a tire."
msgstr ""
" kickstandA da motocicleta para evitar que a moto caia. Você pode "
"usarissopara inclinar para frente ou para trás para trocar um pneu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid "wooden pulley crane"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden pulley crane'}
#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
msgid ""
"A wooden rope and pulley crane.  If it is in your line of sight and within "
"two tiles of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you jack up"
" the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy "
"component like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must"
" have line of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of"
" it."
msgstr ""

