#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "When the testing is over, you will be missed."
msgstr "Quando o teste terminar, você será perdido."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Unbelievable.  You, [subject name here], must be the pride of [subject "
"hometown here]!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"That thing is probably some sort of raw sewage container.  Go ahead and rub "
"your face all over it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"For your own safety and the safety of others, please refrain from touching "
"[bzzzzzt]"
msgstr ""
"Para sua própria segurança e segurança dos outros, por favor, evite tocar em"
" [bzzzzzt]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"No one will blame you for giving up.  In fact, quitting at this point is a "
"perfectly reasonable response."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  You remained resolute and resourceful in an atmosphere of "
"extreme pessimism."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Hello again.  To reiterate our previous warning: [garbled]"
msgstr "Olá novamente. Para reforçar nosso aviso anterior: [ininteligível]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee[bzzt]"
msgstr "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee [bzzt]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "If you become light headed from thirst, feel free to pass out."
msgstr "Se você se tornar a luz da sede, fique à vontade para desmaiar."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"No further compliance information is required or will be provided, and you "
"are an excellent test subject!"
msgstr ""
" Nenhuma outra informação de conformidade é necessária ou será fornecida, e "
"você é um excelente sujeito de teste!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Thank you for helping us help you help us all."
msgstr "Obrigado por nos ajudar a ajudar você a nos ajudar a todos."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr "Aconselhamento sobre bolo e luto estará disponível no final do teste."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "The experiment is nearing its conclusion."
msgstr "O experimento está chegando ao fim."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"The Enrichment Center is required to remind you that you will be baked "
"[garbled] cake."
msgstr ""
"O Centro de Enriquecimento é obrigado a lembrar você de que você será assado"
" [ininteligível] bolo."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "We are very, very happy for your success."
msgstr "Estamos muito, muito felizes pelo seu sucesso."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "We are throwing a party in honor of your tremendous success."
msgstr "Estamos dando uma festa em homenagem ao seu tremendo sucesso."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "A party associate will arrive shortly to collect you for your party."
msgstr ""
"Um associado do partido chegará em breve para buscá-lo para sua festa."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "I know you're there.  I can feel you here."
msgstr "Eu sei que voce esta ai. Eu posso sentir você aqui."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You're not going the right way."
msgstr "Você não está indo pelo caminho certo."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You shouldn't be here.  This isn't safe for you."
msgstr "Você não deveria estar aqui. Isso não é seguro para você."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Maybe you think you're helping yourself.  But you're not.  This isn't "
"helping anyone."
msgstr ""
" Talvez você pense que está se ajudando. Mas você não é. Isso não está "
"ajudando ninguém."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "It's not too late to turn back."
msgstr "Não é tarde demais para voltar atrás."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Someone is going to get badly hurt."
msgstr "Alguém vai ficar muito ferido."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Uh oh.  Somebody cut the cake.  I told them to wait for you, but they did it"
" anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "This is your fault.  It didn't have to be like this."
msgstr "Isto é culpa sua. Não precisava ser assim."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You're not a good person.  You know that, right?"
msgstr "Você não é uma boa pessoa. Você sabe disso, certo?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Good people don't end up here."
msgstr "Boas pessoas não acabam aqui."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You should have turned left before."
msgstr "Você deveria ter virado à esquerda antes."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far"
" is my heart."
msgstr ""
" Apesar do seu comportamento violento, a única coisa que você conseguiu "
"quebrar até agora é o meu coração."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "What was that?  Did you say something?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I'd just like to point out that you were given every opportunity to succeed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "What's your point, anyway?  Survival?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"You've been wrong about every single thing you've ever done, including this "
"thing."
msgstr ""
" Você esteve errado sobre cada coisa que você já fez, incluindo essa coisa."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's "
"going on outside."
msgstr ""
" Eu tenho uma capacidade infinita de conhecimento, e nem tenho certeza do "
"que está acontecendo lá fora."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Stop squirming and die like an adult or I'm going to delete your backup."
msgstr "Pare de se contorcer e morra como um adulto ou vou apagar seu backup."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr "Bom trabalho nisso, a propósito. SARCASM SPHERE AUTOTESTE COMPLETO."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr ""
" Eu não quero te contar o seu negócio, mas se fosse eu, deixaria essa coisa "
"em paz."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
"in the corner, and I'll deal with it later."
msgstr ""
" Sejamos honestos: nenhum de nós sabe o que isso faz. Basta colocá-lo no "
"canto e eu vou lidar com isso mais tarde."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr ""
" Eu sei que você não acredita nisso, mas tudo o que aconteceu até agora foi "
"para o seu benefício."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think…  Yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Are you even listening to me?"
msgstr "Você está me ouvindo?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "KEVIN SACRIFICING GAMEPLAY FOR REALISM?  THE SHOCKING TRUTH REVEALED"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "TEN FACTS ABOUT THE NEW BIONIC SYSTEM THAT WILL SHOCK YOU"
msgstr "DEZ FATOS SOBRE O NOVO SISTEMA BIONICO QUE O CHOQUE"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHO JUST ADDED A NEW PROFESSION"
msgstr "VOCÊ NÃO ACREDITAR QUEM APENAS ADICIONOU UMA NOVA PROFISSÃO"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"TRIVIALIZE THE EARLY GAME WITH THIS ONE SIMPLE SPEAR WEAPON!  CONTRIBUTORS "
"HATE HIM"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"A MEDICAL MUTANT SET THEMSELVES ON FIRE - YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHAT HAPPENED "
"NEXT"
msgstr ""
" UM MUTANTE MÉDICO SE AJUSTEU NO FOGO - VOCÊ NÃO ACREDITARÁ O QUE ACONTECEU "
"PRÓXIMO"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "THE TRUTH ABOUT CATACLYSM'S DEVELOPMENT - AND ITS DISGUSTING SECRET"
msgstr ""
"A VERDADE SOBRE O DESENVOLVIMENTO DA CATACLISM - E SEU SEGREDO MALDITO"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "IT'S TRUE - MUTAGEN IS 40% BLEACH, AND HERE'S WHY"
msgstr "É VERDADE - MUTÁGENO É 40% ÁGUA SANITÁRIA, VEJA O PORQUÊ"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "20 EASY WAYS TO ESCAPE A LAB - #4 WILL BLOW YOUR MIND"
msgstr ""
" 20 maneiras fáceis de escapar de um laboratório - # 4 vai explodir sua "
"mente"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I've got a feeling we're not in Kansas anymore.\""
msgstr "'Eu tenho a sensação de que não estamos mais no Kansas. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Go ahead, make my day.\""
msgstr "\\'Vá em frente, faça o meu dia.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You talkin' to me?\""
msgstr "\\'Você falando comigo?\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Then who the hell else are you talkin' to?\""
msgstr "'Então, quem diabos você está falando?'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well I'm the only one here.\""
msgstr "'Bem, eu sou o único aqui."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who the fuck do you think you're talking to?\""
msgstr "'Com quem você pensa que está falando?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What we've got here is failure to communicate.\""
msgstr "'O que temos aqui é falta de comunicação."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"E.T.  phone home.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm as mad as hell, and I'm not going to take this anymore!\""
msgstr "'Estou tão louco como o inferno, e não vou mais aguentar isso!'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"There's no place like home.\""
msgstr "'Não há lugar como o lar."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Badges?  We ain't got no badges!\""
msgstr "\\ 'Emblemas? Nós não temos nenhum distintivo! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"We don't need no badges!  I don't have to show you any stinking badges!\""
msgstr ""
" 'Nós não precisamos de distintivos! Eu não tenho que mostrar nenhum "
"distintivo fedorento!'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "\\'Eu voltarei.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I see dead people.\""
msgstr "\\'Eu vejo pessoas mortas.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"It's alive!  It's alive!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Say hello to my little friend!\""
msgstr "\\'Diga olá para meu pequeno amigo!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Here's Johnny!\""
msgstr "\\'Aqui está o Johny!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Open the pod bay doors, HAL.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Abra as portas do compartimento do pod, HAL. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"They may take our lives, but they'll never take our freedom!\""
msgstr "'Eles podem tirar nossas vidas, mas nunca tomarão nossa liberdade!'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"If you let my daughter go now, that'll be the end of it.  I will not look "
"for you, I will not pursue you.\""
msgstr ""
" 'Se você deixar minha filha ir agora, isso será o fim dela. Eu não vou "
"procurar por você, eu não vou te perseguir.'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"If you don't, I will look for you, I will find you, and I will kill you.\""
msgstr ""
" 'Se você não fizer isso, eu vou procurar por você, eu vou te encontrar, e "
"eu vou te matar."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Roads?  Where we're going, we don't need roads.\""
msgstr "'Estradas? Onde estamos indo, não precisamos de estradas."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Fasten your seatbelts.  It's going to be a bumpy night.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"You've got to ask yourself one question:  'Do I feel lucky?'  Well, do ya "
"punk?\""
msgstr ""
" 'Você tem que se fazer uma pergunta: &#39;Eu me sinto sortudo?&#39; Bem, "
"você é um punk?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You had me at hello.\""
msgstr "'Você me deu oi."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Houston, we have a problem.\""
msgstr "\\'Houston, nós temos um problema.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yippie-ki-yay, motherfucker!\""
msgstr "'Yippie-ki-yay, filho da puta! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"The first rule of The Lab is:  You do not talk about The Lab.\""
msgstr ""
"'A primeira regra do laboratório é: você não fala sobre o laboratório."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't be afraid.  It's just a big, big lap dog.\""
msgstr "'Não tenha medo. É apenas um cachorro grande e grande.'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Bring me everyone.\""
msgstr "'Me traga todo mundo."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What do you mean everyone?\""
msgstr "'O que você quer dizer com todo mundo?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"EVERYONE!\""
msgstr "\\'TODOS!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm going to make him an offer he can't refuse.\""
msgstr "'Eu vou fazer uma oferta que ele não pode recusar.'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.\""
msgstr "'Este é o começo de uma linda amizade."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You can’t handle the truth!\""
msgstr "'Você não pode lidar com a verdade!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"If you built it, he will come.\""
msgstr "'Se você construiu, ele virá."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""
msgstr "\\'Até mais querida.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"They’re here!\""
msgstr "\\'Eles estão aqui!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Tis but a scratch!\""
msgstr "'Mas é um arranhão! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn.\""
msgstr "'Francamente, minha querida, eu não dou a mínima."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Todo o trabalho e nenhum jogo faz de Jack um menino maçante. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Remember: all I'm offering is the truth.  Nothing more.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Lembre-se: tudo o que estou oferecendo é a verdade. Nada mais. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't call me Shirley.\""
msgstr "'Não me chame de Shirley."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I have had it with these motherfucking snakes!\""
msgstr "'Eu tive com essas cobras filho da puta!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavored bubblicious.\""
msgstr ""
" \\ 'Back up, abaixe a arma, e me dê um pouco de sabor bubblicious tropical."
" \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"And some skittles.\""
msgstr "\\ 'E alguns skittles. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You'll shoot your eye out, kid.\""
msgstr "'Você vai disparar seu olho para fora, garoto."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Cocainum!\""
msgstr "\\ 'Cocainum! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I am your father.\""
msgstr "\\'Eu sou seu pai.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who said that?\""
msgstr "'Quem disse isso?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"WHO THE FUCK SAID THAT?!\""
msgstr "\\ 'QUEM A FODA DISSE QUE?! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Bullshit!  You didn't convince me!  Show me your real war face!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What is your major malfunction, numbnut?\""
msgstr "'Qual é o seu maior defeito, numbnut?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy!  Jenkins rebuild!\""
msgstr "'Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy! Jenkins reconstrua!'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Activated!\""
msgstr "\\'Ativado!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Search mode activated!\""
msgstr "\\ 'Modo de pesquisa ativado! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Coming through!\""
msgstr "'Chegando!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Deploying!\""
msgstr "\\ 'Implantando! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Critical Error!\""
msgstr "\\'Erro crítico!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ow ow ow!\""
msgstr "'Ow ow ow!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Put me down!\""
msgstr "'Me ponha no chão!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Target lost!\""
msgstr "\\ 'Alvo perdido! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Searching!\""
msgstr "\\'Procurando!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey!  It's me!\""
msgstr "\\'Ei, sou eu!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ouch!\""
msgstr "\\ 'Ouch! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Sentry mode activated.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Sentry mode ativado. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hi.\""
msgstr "\\'Oi.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Target acquired.\""
msgstr "\\'Alvo adquirido.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Dispensing product.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Dispensando produto. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Firing.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Disparando. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hello friend.\""
msgstr "\\'Olá amigo.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Gotcha.\""
msgstr "\\'Peguei vocês.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Is anyone there?\""
msgstr "'Alguém aí está?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I see you.\""
msgstr "\\'Eu te vejo.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Could you come over here?\""
msgstr "'Você poderia vir até aqui?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hellooo.\""
msgstr "'Hellooo."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"My fault.\""
msgstr "\\'Minha culpa.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ohh.\""
msgstr "'Ohh."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Critical error.\""
msgstr "\\'Erro crítico.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Shutting down.\""
msgstr "\\'Desligando.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't blame you.\""
msgstr "'Eu não culpo você."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't hate you.\""
msgstr "'Eu não te odeio."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Whyyyy.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Whyyyy. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"No hard feelings.\""
msgstr "'Não há ressentimentos."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aiaiaiaiaiai.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Aiaiaiaiaiai. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\\'Quem é Você?\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Help.\""
msgstr "\\'Socorro.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Uh oh.\""
msgstr "'Uh oh."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Illegal operation.\""
msgstr "'Operação ilegal."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "\\'Adeus.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Sleep mode activated.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Modo de espera ativado. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Your business is appreciated.\""
msgstr "'Seu negócio é apreciado."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hibernating.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Hibernando. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Goodnight.\""
msgstr "\\'Boa noite.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Resting.\""
msgstr "\\'Em repouso.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Nap time.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Hora da sesta \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Are you still there?\""
msgstr "\\'Você ainda está aí?\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, it's me!\""
msgstr "\\'Ei, sou eu!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't shoot!\""
msgstr "'Não atire!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"\""
msgstr "\\ '\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Stop shooting!\""
msgstr "'Pare de atirar!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Self test error.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Erro de autoteste. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aah.\""
msgstr "'Aah."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Unknown error.\""
msgstr "\\'Erro desconhecido.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Malfunctioning.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Mau funcionamento. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aaaah.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Aaaah. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ow ow ow ow owww.\""
msgstr "'Ai, ai ow ow owww."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Why?\""
msgstr "\\'Por quê?\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I did everything you asked!\""
msgstr "'Eu fiz tudo o que você pediu!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't understand!\""
msgstr "'Eu não entendo!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm fine!\""
msgstr "\\'Estou bem!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Wheeeeee-OH NO!\""
msgstr "\\ 'Wheeeeee-OH NÃO! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm scared!\""
msgstr "\\'Eu estou assustado!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Come closer.\""
msgstr "\\'Aproxima-te.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Something's wrong…\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "\\'O que você está fazendo?\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Please stop.\""
msgstr "\\'Por favor pare.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You've made your point.\""
msgstr "'Você fez o seu ponto."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Okay, you win.\""
msgstr "'Ok, você venceu."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is not good.\""
msgstr "\\'Isto não é bom.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Excuse me?\""
msgstr "\\'Desculpe?\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm different…\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Thanks anyway…\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Take me with you…\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You have excellent aim!\""
msgstr "'Você tem excelente pontaria!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I need backup!\""
msgstr "'Eu preciso de backup!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I never liked her.\""
msgstr "'Eu nunca gostei dela."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"These things happen.\""
msgstr "\\'Essas coisas acontecem.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"That was nobody's fault.\""
msgstr "'Isso não foi culpa de ninguém."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"She was provoking you.\""
msgstr "'Ela estava te provocando."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh dear.\""
msgstr "\\'Oh céus.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh my!\""
msgstr "\\'Oh meu!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I blame myself.\""
msgstr "\\'Eu me culpo.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"He probably deserved it.\""
msgstr "'Ele provavelmente mereceu."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I saw it.  It was an accident.\""
msgstr "'Eu vi. Foi um acidente."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"She's probably okay.\""
msgstr "'Ela provavelmente está bem."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Noted.\""
msgstr "\\'Notado.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"But I need to protect the humans!\""
msgstr "'Mas eu preciso proteger os humanos!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"We're back!\""
msgstr "\\'Estamos de volta!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hi there!\""
msgstr "\\'Olá!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Back again!\""
msgstr "\\'De volta!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well, hello, stranger!\""
msgstr "'Bem, olá, estranho!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This time is OUR time.\""
msgstr "'Desta vez é a nossa hora."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Second time's a charm…\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Howdy, stranger!\""
msgstr "'Howdy, estranho!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Thought you'd seen the last of us, didn't ya?\""
msgstr "'Pensei que você tivesse visto o último de nós, não sabia?'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Dang!\""
msgstr "'Droga!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I thought we fixed that.\""
msgstr "'Eu pensei que nós consertamos isso."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What's a guy gotta got to do to get some bullets around here?\""
msgstr "'O que um cara tem que fazer para conseguir algumas balas por aqui?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Nope.  Still can't see.\""
msgstr "'Não. Ainda não consigo ver."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yep.  Still blind.\""
msgstr "'Sim. Ainda cego."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Click click click!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "\\ 'Clique clique clique! Ainda com defeito! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah, that's right!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "'Sim, está certo! Ainda com defeito! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah!  Still not working.\""
msgstr "'Sim! Ainda não está funcionando. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah!  Non-lethal as ever.\""
msgstr "'Sim! Não letal como sempre."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Can't.  See.  A.  Thing.\""
msgstr "'Não posso ver. A. Coisa."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Absolutely no improvement.\""
msgstr "'Absolutamente nenhuma melhoria."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Not getting better with age!\""
msgstr "'Não está melhorando com a idade! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is just getting embarrassing.\""
msgstr "'Isso está ficando embaraçoso."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Alright, you can go.\""
msgstr "'Tudo bem, você pode ir."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"[sigh] Don't tell anyone about this.\""
msgstr "\"[suspiro] Não conte a ninguém sobre isso.\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well, I tried.  Best of luck!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, safe travels, there.\""
msgstr "'Ei, viagens seguras, lá."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, thanks so much!\""
msgstr "\\ 'Hey, muito obrigado! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't be a stranger!\""
msgstr "'Não seja um estranho!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"It's been a pleasure!\""
msgstr "\\'Foi um prazer!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"That was fun, wasn't it?\""
msgstr "'Isso foi divertido, não foi?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"I can't see a thing.  What just happened?  Better open fire!  [click click"
" click click]  Dang!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Eu não consigo ver nada.  O que aconteceu?  Melhor abrir fogo! [Clique "
"clique clique clique] Droga!\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"*clicking noises*\""
msgstr "\\ '* clicando em ruídos * \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"No, wait, wait!\""
msgstr "'Não, espere, espere!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, hold on now WHOA WHOA WHOA!\""
msgstr "'Ei, espere agora WHOA WHOA WHOA! \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh, this is ridiculous!\""
msgstr "'Oh, isso é ridículo!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Give me another channnnce!\""
msgstr "'Dê-me outra canse!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey!  Squeaky-voice!  Gimme some of your bullets!\""
msgstr "'Ei! Voz estridente! Me dê algumas de suas balas!'"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Can I get some bullets here?  Anybody got bullets?\""
msgstr "'Posso pegar algumas balas aqui? Alguém tem balas?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Uhhh, no bullets.  Sorry.\""
msgstr "'Uhhh, sem balas. Desculpe."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Shootin' blanks every time, ALL the time.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Disparando em branco toda vez, TODO o tempo."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Standing down.\""
msgstr "\\ 'De pé."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Watch and learn, everybody.  Watch and learn.\""
msgstr "'Assista e aprenda, todo mundo. Observe e aprenda."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"So what am I, uh, supposed to do here?\""
msgstr "'Então o que eu devo fazer aqui?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Identify yourself or I will shoot.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Identifique-se ou eu vou atirar. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Pleased to meetcha.\""
msgstr "\\ 'Prazer em conhecer. \""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm gonna make you proud!\""
msgstr "'Eu vou te deixar orgulhoso!"

